#
# mount_test manifest -- the policy for a task that mounts one prefix of its
# own and nothing else (#716).
#
# 🔑 The grant is the test.  The task is unprivileged everywhere but
# /mount_test: what it is refused under "/" and "/etc" is refused to a task
# that holds a mount capability, the wrong one -- which is a closer miss than
# holding none, and the one a capability for any prefix would not refuse.

name mount_test

# RESOURCE_MOUNT_POINT (3), "/mount_test" alone, REGISTER (0x1).
required 3 name:/mount_test 0x1
